# Internal-only docs (repo is public — work lists, roadmap/strategy, agent instructions,
# operational/security runbooks, session logs, and detailed archives of content cut from the
# public docs stay local-only, not pushed). Contributor-facing technical docs (ARCHITECTURE.md,
# I18N.md, STREAMER_SYSTEM.md, DISCORD_*.md) are unaffected and stay public.
docs/WORK_PROGRESS.md
docs/ROADMAP.md
docs/AGENTS.md
docs/PROGRESSION.md
docs/ADMIN_GUIDE.md
docs/PRODUCTION_INTEGRATIONS.md
docs/GAME_DEPLOY_SMOKE_TEST.md
docs/logs/
docs/runbooks/
docs/archive/
apps/api/.b2-secret.env
apps/api/.dev.vars
apps/api/b2-smoke-test.txt
# Generated only after CI verifies the remote Staging D1 name and UUID. It must never be committed.
apps/api/wrangler.staging.generated.jsonc

# Generated from apps/api/test/fixtures/game-deploy-smoke-test/ball-dodge/ by
# build-ball-dodge-zip.mjs — a build artifact (the sandbox-game pipeline smoke-test upload
# fixture), not source. Regenerate with:
#   node apps/api/test/fixtures/game-deploy-smoke-test/build-ball-dodge-zip.mjs
apps/api/test/fixtures/game-deploy-smoke-test/ball-dodge.zip

# examples/ball-dodge/ (Game Bridge reference integration) build output — vendor/ is
# @owogg/game-sdk/bridge's source, copied fresh on every build (see build.mjs), never committed;
# ball-dodge.zip is the resulting upload artifact. dist/ is already covered above.
examples/ball-dodge/vendor/
examples/ball-dodge/ball-dodge.zip
